  "description": "Perform a lookup for IOCs to retrieve the list of objects available in Intel Exchange. If some IOCs are not available in the platform, you can choose to create intel and ingest the missing IOCs. You can look up and ingest a maximum of 1000 IOCs in an API request.\n\nYou can perform a lookup for the following IOC types:\n\n*   IPv4\n    \n*   IPv6\n    \n*   Email Address\n    \n*   MD5\n    \n*   SHA1\n    \n*   SHA256\n    \n*   SHA512\n    \n*   SSDEEP\n    \n*   URL\n    \n*   Domain",
  "method": "POST",
  "path": "ingestion/threat-data/bulk-lookup-and-create/",
